,"height":36},{"text":"파이프의","x":1520,"y":785,"width":149,"height":38},{"text":"읽","x":1690,"y":787,"width":27,"height":37}]},{"text":"기 또는 쓰기 핸들로 재지정해야 한다. 자식 프로세스가 파이프로부터 읽도록 만들어야","words":[{"text":"기","x":316,"y":853,"width":29,"height":37},{"text":"또는","x":364,"y":854,"width":71,"height":35},{"text":"쓰기","x":449,"y":852,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"핸들로","x":534,"y":852,"width":102,"height":36},{"text":"재지정해야","x":651,"y":850,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":838,"y":850,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"자식","x":932,"y":849,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":1016,"y":850,"width":178,"height":37},{"text":"파이프로부터","x":1208,"y":849,"width":213,"height":38},{"text":"읽도록","x":1444,"y":849,"width":111,"height":36},{"text":"만들어야","x":1572,"y":847,"width":149,"height":39}]},{"text":"하기 때문에 부모 프로세스는 자식의 표준 입력을 파이프의 읽기 핸들로 재지정해야만","words":[{"text":"하기","x":315,"y":915,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"때문에","x":401,"y":915,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"부모","x":520,"y":915,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"프로세스는","x":603,"y":914,"width":173,"height":38},{"text":"자식의","x":792,"y":913,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"표준","x":912,"y":915,"width":70,"height":34},{"text":"입력을","x":1000,"y":912,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"파이프의","x":1118,"y":912,"width":138,"height":38},{"text":"읽기","x":1280,"y":912,"width":64,"height":37},{"text":"핸들로","x":1367,"y":912,"width":109,"height":36},{"text":"재지정해야만","x":1495,"y":910,"width":226,"height":38}]},{"text":"한다. 더욱이 파이프는 반이중 방식이므로 자식이 파이프의 쓰기 종단을 상속받는 것을","words":[{"text":"한다.","x":314,"y":979,"width":77,"height":38},{"text":"더욱이","x":410,"y":979,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"파이프는","x":527,"y":978,"width":139,"height":38},{"text":"반이중","x":680,"y":977,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"방식이므로","x":798,"y":976,"width":173,"height":39},{"text":"자식이","x":986,"y":975,"width":100,"height":39},{"text":"파이프의","x":1106,"y":976,"width":138,"height":37},{"text":"쓰기","x":1264,"y":975,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"종단을","x":1351,"y":975,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"상속받는","x":1478,"y":973,"width":154,"height":38},{"text":"것을","x":1649,"y":972,"width":71,"height":39}]},{"text":"금지시켜야 한다. 자식 프로세스를 생성하는 것은 그림 3.10과 한 가지만 빼놓고 유사","words":[{"text":"금지시켜야","x":313,"y":1043,"width":175,"height":38},{"text":"한다.","x":504,"y":1042,"width":75,"height":37},{"text":"자식","x":598,"y":1041,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스를","x":683,"y":1040,"width":174,"height":38},{"text":"생성하는","x":873,"y":1040,"width":140,"height":38},{"text":"것은","x":1032,"y":1039,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"그림","x":1117,"y":1038,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"3.10과","x":1204,"y":1038,"width":110,"height":37},{"text":"한","x":1330,"y":1038,"width":37,"height":35},{"text":"가지만","x":1385,"y":1037,"width":111,"height":37},{"text":"빼놓고","x":1514,"y":1036,"width":115,"height":37},{"text":"유사","x":1646,"y":1036,"width":74,"height":39}]},{"text":"하다. 한 가지 차이점은 자식 프로세스가 지정된 핸들을 부모로부터 상속받을 수 있도록","words":[{"text":"하다.","x":314,"y":1106,"width":76,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":406,"y":1106,"width":36,"height":37},{"text":"가지","x":456,"y":1105,"width":62,"height":39},{"text":"차이점은","x":536,"y":1104,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"자식","x":686,"y":1104,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"프로세스가","x":768,"y":1103,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"지정된","x":958,"y":1102,"width":101,"height":39},{"text":"핸들을","x":1076,"y":1101,"width":106,"height":37},{"text":"부모로부터","x":1195,"y":1099,"width":176,"height":39},{"text":"상속받을","x":1389,"y":1099,"width":151,"height":38},{"text":"수","x":1554,"y":1098,"width":40,"height":37},{"text":"있도록","x":1611,"y":1097,"width":108,"height":39}]},{"text":"5번째 매개변수를 TRUE로 지정해 주는 것이다. 파이프에 쓰기 전에 부모는 먼저 파이","words":[{"text":"5번째","x":312,"y":1170,"width":87,"height":37},{"text":"매개변수를","x":417,"y":1169,"width":171,"height":38},{"text":"TRUE로","x":601,"y":1171,"width":141,"height":29},{"text":"지정해","x":758,"y":1167,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"주는","x":875,"y":1169,"width":71,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.